---
// Side-view elevation scale showing 5 discrete z-axis levels from base surface
// up to floating modals/dragged items, with shadow spread and blur growing together.
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
const baseY = 235;

const steps = [
  { level: 1, en: 'Button', vi: 'Nút bấm', token: 'sm', z: 14, shadowW: 86, shadowOp: 0.22 },
  { level: 2, en: 'Card', vi: 'Thẻ nội dung', token: 'md', z: 34, shadowW: 96, shadowOp: 0.18 },
  { level: 3, en: 'Dropdown', vi: 'Menu thả xuống', token: 'lg', z: 62, shadowW: 108, shadowOp: 0.15 },
  { level: 4, en: 'Popover', vi: 'Hộp nổi', token: 'xl', z: 96, shadowW: 120, shadowOp: 0.12 },
  { level: 5, en: 'Modal / drag', vi: 'Hộp thoại / kéo', token: '2xl', z: 134, shadowW: 134, shadowOp: 0.10 },
];

const startX = 115;
const gapX = 165;
---
<figure class="des">
  <div class="des-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Side-view diagram of a 5-step elevation scale along the z-axis: Button (sm), Card (md), Dropdown (lg), Popover (xl), and Modal or dragged item (2xl). Higher elements sit farther above the base surface and cast wider, softer shadows.">
      <!-- Y-axis (z-height) -->
      <line x1="48" y1="44" x2="48" y2={baseY} class="des-axis" />
      <polygon points="44,48 52,48 48,38" class="des-arrow" />
      <text x="58" y="46" class="des-axis-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Closer to user (z-axis)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Gần mắt người dùng hơn (trục z)</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Base surface line -->
      <line x1="48" y1={baseY} x2="870" y2={baseY} class="des-base" />
      <text x="870" y={baseY + 22} text-anchor="end" class="des-base-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Level 0: base canvas</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bậc 0: nền chính</tspan>
      </text>

      {steps.map((s, i) => {
        const cx = startX + i * gapX;
        const boxY = baseY - s.z - 22;
        const isHigh = s.level === 5;
        return (
          <g>
            {/* Dashed height guide */}
            <line x1={cx} y1={boxY + 22} x2={cx} y2={baseY - 4} class="des-guide" />
            {/* Projected shadow on base surface */}
            <ellipse
              cx={cx}
              cy={baseY}
              rx={s.shadowW / 2}
              ry={3 + s.level * 1.1}
              class="des-shadow"
              style={`opacity: ${s.shadowOp};`}
            />
            {/* Elevated slab */}
            <rect
              x={cx - 46}
              y={boxY}
              width="92"
              height="22"
              rx="4"
              class:list={['des-slab', { 'is-high': isHigh }]}
            />
            {/* Token label inside slab */}
            <text x={cx} y={boxY + 15} text-anchor="middle" class:list={['des-token', { 'is-high': isHigh }]}>
              {s.token}
            </text>
            {/* Role label above slab */}
            <text x={cx} y={boxY - 10} text-anchor="middle" class="des-role">
              <tspan data-lang-en>{s.en}</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi}</tspan>
            </text>
            {/* Level tick below base */}
            <text x={cx} y={baseY + 22} text-anchor="middle" class="des-lvl">
              <tspan data-lang-en>L{s.level}</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Bậc {s.level}</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
        );
      })}

      <!-- Bottom trend annotation -->
      <text x="48" y="294" class="des-trend">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Higher z-height → larger vertical offset, wider blur, lower contact opacity, stronger visual priority</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trục z càng cao → bóng đổ xa hơn, mờ rộng hơn, bóng tiếp xúc nhạt dần, mức độ thu hút sự chú ý càng mạnh</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Choose an element's elevation role first; the shadow size follows the scale instead of ad-hoc pixel guessing.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn vai trò độ cao của thành phần trước; kích thước bóng đổ tự động đi theo thang thay vì chỉnh tay từng pixel.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .des { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .des-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .des svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .des text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .des-axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .des-arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .des text.des-axis-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .des-base { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 2; }
  .des text.des-base-label { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .des-guide { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .des-shadow { fill: var(--text); }
  .des-slab { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .des-slab.is-high { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .des text.des-token { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .des text.des-token.is-high { fill: var(--red); }
  .des text.des-role { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .des text.des-lvl { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .des text.des-trend { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .des figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
